{
  "episode": "ep10",
  "title": "二つの大戦と現代日本",
  "gaps": {
    "beat": 0.3,
    "scene": 0.6,
    "section": 0.8,
    "tail": 0.6
  },
  "total_duration": 569.588,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "section": "opening",
      "start": 0.0,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b00.wav",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 4.885,
          "text": "ねえ先生、どうして日本は戦争に負けて、こんなに豊かになったの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b01.wav",
          "start": 5.185,
          "duration": 5.963,
          "text": "実は、負けたあとに日本最大の転機があったんです!二つの大戦から現代まで、見ていきましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b02.wav",
          "start": 11.448,
          "duration": 2.507,
          "text": "よし、ラストまで、走るのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 14.755,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b00.wav",
          "start": 14.755,
          "duration": 1.984,
          "text": "民権って、なんなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b01.wav",
          "start": 17.039,
          "duration": 1.461,
          "text": "国民の権利のことです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b02.wav",
          "start": 18.8,
          "duration": 2.155,
          "text": "1874年の建白書から始まった運動で、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b03.wav",
          "start": 21.255,
          "duration": 2.677,
          "text": "板垣退助らが各地に社を作って広めました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b04.wav",
          "start": 24.232,
          "duration": 2.368,
          "text": "国会と、自由を求めるのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b05.wav",
          "start": 26.9,
          "duration": 4.0,
          "text": "ええ、「国会開設の建白」など運動は政府に届き、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b06.wav",
          "start": 31.2,
          "duration": 7.573,
          "text": "国会開設を約束します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b07.wav",
          "start": 39.073,
          "duration": 1.995,
          "text": "1890年の予定です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b08.wav",
          "start": 41.368,
          "duration": 2.496,
          "text": "民の声、国会まで届いたのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 44.464,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b00.wav",
          "start": 44.464,
          "duration": 1.92,
          "text": "その国会で使うルールは?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b01.wav",
          "start": 46.684,
          "duration": 4.043,
          "text": "1889年、大日本帝国憲法が発布されます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b02.wav",
          "start": 51.027,
          "duration": 4.267,
          "text": "天皇が与える欽定憲法で、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b03.wav",
          "start": 55.593,
          "duration": 2.475,
          "text": "伊藤博文らがヨーロッパを調べて作りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b04.wav",
          "start": 58.368,
          "duration": 3.584,
          "text": "大日本帝国憲法って、今の憲法なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b05.wav",
          "start": 62.252,
          "duration": 3.872,
          "text": "いいえ、今のは1947年の日本国憲法。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b06.wav",
          "start": 66.424,
          "duration": 3.253,
          "text": "1889年の帝国憲法とは別物です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b07.wav",
          "start": 69.977,
          "duration": 3.488,
          "text": "1889年、欽定憲法なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b08.wav",
          "start": 73.765,
          "duration": 5.312,
          "text": "ええ、1890年には第1回帝国議会が開かれます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b09.wav",
          "start": 79.377,
          "duration": 4.277,
          "text": "ただし、選挙権は納税額で制限されていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b10.wav",
          "start": 83.955,
          "duration": 2.645,
          "text": "まだ、一部の人だけの選挙なのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 87.2,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b00.wav",
          "start": 87.2,
          "duration": 2.165,
          "text": "日本は、世界へ出たのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b01.wav",
          "start": 89.665,
          "duration": 2.827,
          "text": "ええ、朝鮮をめぐって中国と対立し、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b02.wav",
          "start": 92.792,
          "duration": 7.701,
          "text": "1894年に日清戦争が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b03.wav",
          "start": 100.793,
          "duration": 3.296,
          "text": "翌年、日本が勝って下関条約を結びました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b04.wav",
          "start": 104.389,
          "duration": 3.765,
          "text": "台湾と賠償金が手に入る…って条約なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b05.wav",
          "start": 108.455,
          "duration": 6.123,
          "text": "ええ、ただロシアなど三国の干渉で、遼東半島は返さされました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b06.wav",
          "start": 114.877,
          "duration": 3.115,
          "text": "弱い日本に、理不尽な圧力です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b07.wav",
          "start": 118.292,
          "duration": 2.197,
          "text": "三国干渉、くやしいのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 121.089,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b00.wav",
          "start": 121.089,
          "duration": 1.792,
          "text": "次は、ロシアなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b01.wav",
          "start": 123.181,
          "duration": 6.549,
          "text": "1904年、満洲と朝鮮の権益をめぐって、日露戦争が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b02.wav",
          "start": 130.031,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "旅順の攻防など、激しい戦いが続きました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b03.wav",
          "start": 134.341,
          "duration": 2.315,
          "text": "大国ロシアに、勝ったのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b04.wav",
          "start": 136.956,
          "duration": 3.477,
          "text": "ええ、アメリカの仲介でポーツマス条約を結びます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b05.wav",
          "start": 140.733,
          "duration": 4.565,
          "text": "樺太南部や南満洲鉄道の権益を得ましたが、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b06.wav",
          "start": 145.599,
          "duration": 1.685,
          "text": "賠償金はありませんでした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b07.wav",
          "start": 147.584,
          "duration": 3.072,
          "text": "マナブ、ポーツマス条約で得たもの、覚えてる?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b08.wav",
          "start": 150.956,
          "duration": 3.381,
          "text": "樺太南部と満洲鉄道の権益、なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b09.wav",
          "start": 154.637,
          "duration": 3.744,
          "text": "勝ったのに賠償なし、講和反対事件も起きたのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 158.981,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b00.wav",
          "start": 158.981,
          "duration": 2.528,
          "text": "その後の朝鮮は、どうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b01.wav",
          "start": 161.809,
          "duration": 5.312,
          "text": "日本は影響を強め、1910年、韓国を併合します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b02.wav",
          "start": 167.421,
          "duration": 4.576,
          "text": "韓国の人々の土地や自由が、大きく奪われました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b03.wav",
          "start": 172.297,
          "duration": 2.027,
          "text": "許さずに、奪ったのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b04.wav",
          "start": 174.624,
          "duration": 2.773,
          "text": "そう、痛みは長く続きました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b05.wav",
          "start": 177.697,
          "duration": 4.896,
          "text": "歴史から、この事実を学び続けることが大切なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b06.wav",
          "start": 182.893,
          "duration": 1.952,
          "text": "うん、忘れないのだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 185.445,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b00.wav",
          "start": 185.445,
          "duration": 3.221,
          "text": "次は大正なのだ?平和な時代なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b01.wav",
          "start": 188.967,
          "duration": 3.243,
          "text": "大正にはデモクラシーの波が広がります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b02.wav",
          "start": 192.509,
          "duration": 4.373,
          "text": "明治は国家が主役だったけれど、大正は民衆が主役なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b03.wav",
          "start": 197.183,
          "duration": 1.045,
          "text": "鋭い比較です!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b04.wav",
          "start": 198.528,
          "duration": 5.344,
          "text": "原敬内閣など政党内閣が生まれ、大衆社会が育ちました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b05.wav",
          "start": 204.172,
          "duration": 2.357,
          "text": "みんなで政治を考える時代なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b06.wav",
          "start": 206.829,
          "duration": 2.496,
          "text": "ええ、米騒動のようなどう乱もあり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b07.wav",
          "start": 209.625,
          "duration": 2.037,
          "text": "社会には大きな揺らぎもありました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b08.wav",
          "start": 211.963,
          "duration": 2.411,
          "text": "豊かさと、ゆらぎが同居なのだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 214.973,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b00.wav",
          "start": 214.973,
          "duration": 2.037,
          "text": "選挙は、広がったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b01.wav",
          "start": 217.311,
          "duration": 3.435,
          "text": "1925年、普通選挙法が成立します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b02.wav",
          "start": 221.045,
          "duration": 3.701,
          "text": "納税の条件をなくして、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b03.wav",
          "start": 225.047,
          "duration": 3.243,
          "text": "25歳以上の男子全員に選挙権が与えられました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b04.wav",
          "start": 228.589,
          "duration": 3.285,
          "text": "25歳以上の男子だけ…まだ狭いなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b05.wav",
          "start": 232.175,
          "duration": 2.379,
          "text": "そう、女性は対象外でした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b06.wav",
          "start": 234.853,
          "duration": 6.549,
          "text": "同じ年に治安維持法も作られ、批判の自由は厳しく制限されました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b07.wav",
          "start": 241.703,
          "duration": 2.507,
          "text": "広がりと、しめつけが同時なのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 244.809,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b00.wav",
          "start": 244.809,
          "duration": 2.507,
          "text": "世界の経済は、どうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b01.wav",
          "start": 247.616,
          "duration": 4.043,
          "text": "なぜならアメリカで始まった世界恐慌が波及したからです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b02.wav",
          "start": 251.959,
          "duration": 4.8,
          "text": "その結果、日本の輸出も落ち込み、失業者があふれました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b03.wav",
          "start": 257.059,
          "duration": 2.197,
          "text": "つらさが、日本にも来たのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b04.wav",
          "start": 259.556,
          "duration": 5.781,
          "text": "ええ、苦しい中で、軍や右派の力が強くなっていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b05.wav",
          "start": 265.637,
          "duration": 3.499,
          "text": "ここから、危険な方向へ動き始めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b06.wav",
          "start": 269.436,
          "duration": 2.208,
          "text": "暗い時代の、入り口なのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 272.244,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b00.wav",
          "start": 272.244,
          "duration": 2.315,
          "text": "そして、戦争へ向かったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b01.wav",
          "start": 274.859,
          "duration": 4.523,
          "text": "1931年、関東軍が満洲事変を起こします。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b02.wav",
          "start": 279.681,
          "duration": 5.909,
          "text": "政府を無視した軍の行動で、日本は国際的な批判を受けました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b03.wav",
          "start": 285.891,
          "duration": 2.357,
          "text": "国際連盟も、脱退なのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b04.wav",
          "start": 288.548,
          "duration": 6.603,
          "text": "ええ、1937年には日中戦争へ拡大し、戦争は長期化しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b05.wav",
          "start": 295.451,
          "duration": 3.189,
          "text": "国民のくらしも、どんどん窮迫します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b06.wav",
          "start": 298.94,
          "duration": 2.101,
          "text": "止められない、歯車なのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 301.641,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b00.wav",
          "start": 301.641,
          "duration": 2.528,
          "text": "そして、世界中が戦争なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b01.wav",
          "start": 304.469,
          "duration": 6.624,
          "text": "1940年、日本はドイツやイタリアと日独伊三国同盟を結びます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b02.wav",
          "start": 311.393,
          "duration": 5.739,
          "text": "1941年、真珠湾を攻撃して、太平洋戦争が始まりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b03.wav",
          "start": 317.432,
          "duration": 2.581,
          "text": "アジアじゅうまで、戦場になったのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b04.wav",
          "start": 320.313,
          "duration": 4.0,
          "text": "そう、沖縄では地上戦、東京など大都市では空襲があり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b05.wav",
          "start": 324.613,
          "duration": 7.723,
          "text": "多くの命が失われました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b06.wav",
          "start": 332.636,
          "duration": 3.221,
          "text": "国の力も、たくさんの痛みも、使い果たしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b07.wav",
          "start": 336.157,
          "duration": 2.336,
          "text": "忘れてはいけない、痛みなのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 339.093,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b00.wav",
          "start": 339.093,
          "duration": 2.112,
          "text": "戦争は、どう終わったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b01.wav",
          "start": 341.505,
          "duration": 5.675,
          "text": "広島と長崎には原爆が投下され、たくさんの命が失われました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b02.wav",
          "start": 347.48,
          "duration": 3.413,
          "text": "これは決して忘れてはいけない歴史です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b03.wav",
          "start": 351.193,
          "duration": 3.616,
          "text": "1945年、アメリカなどがポツダム宣言を出し、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b04.wav",
          "start": 355.109,
          "duration": 7.339,
          "text": "日本はこれを受諾して降伏します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b05.wav",
          "start": 362.748,
          "duration": 2.592,
          "text": "8月15日、戦争が終わりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b06.wav",
          "start": 365.64,
          "duration": 3.275,
          "text": "8月15日、忘れてはいけない日なのだ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b07.wav",
          "start": 369.215,
          "duration": 3.093,
          "text": "ええ、国は焼け野原になりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b08.wav",
          "start": 372.608,
          "duration": 5.611,
          "text": "しかし、日本はここから、新しい国をもう一度作り始めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b09.wav",
          "start": 378.519,
          "duration": 1.92,
          "text": "ゼロから、やり直すのだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 381.039,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b00.wav",
          "start": 381.039,
          "duration": 2.656,
          "text": "新しい国の、ルールはなんなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b01.wav",
          "start": 383.995,
          "duration": 3.936,
          "text": "1947年、日本国憲法が施行されます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b02.wav",
          "start": 388.231,
          "duration": 6.603,
          "text": "国民主権、基本的人権の尊重、戦争放棄の9条が、三大原則です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b03.wav",
          "start": 395.133,
          "duration": 2.933,
          "text": "戦わない国、日本国憲法なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b04.wav",
          "start": 398.367,
          "duration": 6.016,
          "text": "ええ、その後は戦後復興をへて、高度経済成長の時代へ進みます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b05.wav",
          "start": 404.683,
          "duration": 3.584,
          "text": "新幹線など、成長のシンボルが生まれました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b06.wav",
          "start": 408.567,
          "duration": 3.285,
          "text": "焼け野原から、大国までなのだ!すごいのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 412.652,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b00.wav",
          "start": 412.652,
          "duration": 3.925,
          "text": "ここから受験ポイントのまとめ!まずは、憲法と戦争への道。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b01.wav",
          "start": 416.877,
          "duration": 9.963,
          "text": "自由民権運動→大日本帝国憲法1889年・帝国議会1890年。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b02.wav",
          "start": 427.14,
          "duration": 4.715,
          "text": "日清戦争1894年、日露戦争1904年、韓国併合1910年。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b03.wav",
          "start": 432.155,
          "duration": 1.984,
          "text": "この流れは完璧に!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b04.wav",
          "start": 434.439,
          "duration": 7.136,
          "text": "「89憲法・90議会・94日清・04日露・10併合」の並びです。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 442.175,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b00.wav",
          "start": 442.175,
          "duration": 2.912,
          "text": "後半は、民主化と戦争、そして戦後です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b01.wav",
          "start": 445.387,
          "duration": 6.667,
          "text": "大正デモクラシー、普通選挙法1925年、世界恐慌1929年。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b02.wav",
          "start": 452.353,
          "duration": 5.568,
          "text": "満洲事変1931年、日中戦争1937年、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b03.wav",
          "start": 458.221,
          "duration": 7.104,
          "text": "三国同盟・太平洋戦争1941年、ポツダム宣言受諾1945年。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b04.wav",
          "start": 465.625,
          "duration": 4.832,
          "text": "そして日本国憲法1947年、高度経済成長。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b05.wav",
          "start": 470.757,
          "duration": 3.211,
          "text": "これで全10話の流れがつながります!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 474.768,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b00.wav",
          "start": 474.768,
          "duration": 2.283,
          "text": "それでは最終クイズ!第一問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b01.wav",
          "start": 477.351,
          "duration": 8.853,
          "text": "1889年に発布された、日本で最初の近代憲法は何でしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b02.wav",
          "start": 486.504,
          "duration": 4.512,
          "text": "ア、大日本帝国憲法。イ、日本国憲法。ウ、十七条憲法。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b03.wav",
          "start": 491.316,
          "duration": 2.048,
          "text": "明治の憲法…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b04.wav",
          "start": 493.664,
          "duration": 2.421,
          "text": "正解!大日本帝国憲法です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b05.wav",
          "start": 496.385,
          "duration": 3.893,
          "text": "日本国憲法は1947年、間違えないように!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 500.879,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b00.wav",
          "start": 500.879,
          "duration": 0.661,
          "text": "第二問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b01.wav",
          "start": 501.84,
          "duration": 7.787,
          "text": "1941年、真珠湾攻撃から始まった戦争は何でしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b02.wav",
          "start": 509.927,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "ア、太平洋戦争。イ、日露戦争。ウ、日清戦争。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b03.wav",
          "start": 514.237,
          "duration": 2.763,
          "text": "1941年…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b04.wav",
          "start": 517.3,
          "duration": 2.144,
          "text": "正解!太平洋戦争です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b05.wav",
          "start": 519.744,
          "duration": 3.125,
          "text": "多くの命が失われた戦争、忘れないでください。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 523.469,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b00.wav",
          "start": 523.469,
          "duration": 0.843,
          "text": "ラスト問題!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b01.wav",
          "start": 524.612,
          "duration": 7.541,
          "text": "1947年に施行された、国の最高法規は何でしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b02.wav",
          "start": 532.453,
          "duration": 4.651,
          "text": "ア、日本国憲法。イ、大日本帝国憲法。ウ、御成敗式目。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b03.wav",
          "start": 537.404,
          "duration": 2.069,
          "text": "戦後の憲法…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b04.wav",
          "start": 539.773,
          "duration": 4.171,
          "text": "正解!日本国憲法です。三大原則としっかりおぼえましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "ending",
      "start": 544.744,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b00.wav",
          "start": 544.744,
          "duration": 2.56,
          "text": "全10話、おつきあいありがとうございました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b01.wav",
          "start": 547.604,
          "duration": 2.965,
          "text": "縄文から現代まで、日本史を駆け抜けました!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b02.wav",
          "start": 550.869,
          "duration": 3.616,
          "text": "黒船も、明治の改革も、二つの大戦も…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b03.wav",
          "start": 554.785,
          "duration": 2.421,
          "text": "なんでも記憶に残るアニメだったのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b04.wav",
          "start": 557.507,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "ええ、歴史は「なぜ」の連続です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b05.wav",
          "start": 560.857,
          "duration": 2.421,
          "text": "この先も、好奇心でたどってみてください!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b06.wav",
          "start": 563.579,
          "duration": 2.304,
          "text": "ヒスト先生、ありがとうなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b07.wav",
          "start": 566.183,
          "duration": 2.805,
          "text": "チャンネル登録も、ずっとよろしくなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sections": {
